          "content": "This bug was fixed in the package sabnzbdplus - 5.1.3+dfsg-1\n\n---------------\nsabnzbdplus (5.1.3+dfsg-1) unstable; urgency=medium\n\n  * New upstream release:\n    + fixes a further two vulnerabilities. (Closes: #1147154)\n  * Patches: refresh 02.\n  * Patches: add 90 to avoid an error on the salsa CI.\n\n -- Jeroen Ploemen <email address hidden>  Tue, 08 Sep 2026 13:33:24 +0000\n\nsabnzbdplus (5.1.2+dfsg-1) unstable; urgency=medium\n\n  * New upstream release:\n    + fixes two vulnerabilities. (Closes: #1145563)\n  * Patches: refresh 02, 08, and 10.\n\n -- Jeroen Ploemen <email address hidden>  Tue, 25 Aug 2026 16:07:23 +0000",
